body:
You can see the algorithm for detecting TS here: https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/blob/369a865237df4388c6421d5eae7ed948dd606606/packages/scaffold-config/src/detect.ts#L106

If anyone is having this (or a similar issue) please run with `DEBUG=cypress:scaffold-config:detect yarn cypress open`. This should give additional debugging in the terminal, and tell us exactly **why** TS is getting detected. You could then include this output in your bug report.

@qntm can you share a minimum, slimmed down version demonstrating the error? I tried creating a project with "type": "module"`, where my pluginsFile is using ES syntax (`export default`) and the migration worked okay. I think I'm missing something that's preventing me from reproduction and fixing the problem you are encountering.
